WEBVTT

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:05.910
Charioce XVII razed
the demons' capital, Cocytus,

00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:12.040
abducted many demons from their homes,
and enslaved them.

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:16.420
If you have demonkind blood
running through your veins, then use your power for us!

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:19.130
We finally meet, Rag Demon!

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:23.760
Charioce!

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:27.760
So this is the red dragon.

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:36.730
I'm sure even you have heard the rumors

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:42.240
about the dragon who routed the humans with
overwhelming power and sent the capital in a panic?

00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:44.530
What are you planning on doing?

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:49.040
We will be joining you
in your big day of celebration.

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:57.420
Let's go.

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:19.190
Rage of Bahamut

00:03:20.310 --> 00:03:22.400
Please turn back. Beyond this point—

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:37.620
Your Majesty,
please do not attend the parade.

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:42.630
The demons are involved in suspicious activities.

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:46.960
Do you mean the Rag Demon?

00:03:51.220 --> 00:03:52.430
Yes.

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:55.850
I believe his name was Azazel, was it not?

00:03:56.010 --> 00:03:57.600
Yes, My Lord.

00:03:58.020 --> 00:04:01.060
Do you not think it would be entertaining?

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:06.440
It was on this day that the demon capital Cocytus fell.

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:10.950
It is a day to celebrate the time
mankind overcame its fear of demons.

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:16.240
Let us liven things up

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:17.990
with the rag demon's head.

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:20.120
Your Majesty!

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:24.000
The parade will be carried out as scheduled.

00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:26.170
If the demons mean to interfere,

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:29.170
we will merely slaughter them all.

00:05:55.550 --> 00:05:59.180
Today's special is a vegetable omelet,
zombie-style!

00:06:00.850 --> 00:06:07.900
A delicious zombie omelet just as good
as yesterday's spicy chicken wings!

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:09.360
Zombie?

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:11.690
-Is it rotten or something?
-Watch it.

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:13.400
It's not rotten!

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:15.950
It's a legendary flavor over 200 years old.

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:18.950
Just try a bite!

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:20.660
I'll take one, then.

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:21.830
Me too.

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:24.120
-I'll have one, please.
-Could I get one too?

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:28.250
Okay.
Rita, we've got four orders for our zombie omelet.

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:29.790
Okey dokey.

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:33.460
I'm surprised they'd order something with this name.

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:37.630
Thank you!

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:45.930
I'm sorry.

00:06:46.270 --> 00:06:48.980
It was fun.
I hope we can see each other again.

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:50.730
Here you go, thanks!

00:06:50.900 --> 00:06:53.940
Please come again! There you go!

00:06:54.650 --> 00:06:57.650
It'd be nice if that handsome guy
from yesterday showed up again.

00:06:58.030 --> 00:07:00.160
What? Who are you talking about?

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:03.660
They say that what happens twice will happen thrice.

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:06.580
Not you too, Rita.

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:08.870
The arm wrestling, last night's festival,

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:11.380
and now today.

00:07:14.090 --> 00:07:16.210
You're not making any sense.

00:07:16.380 --> 00:07:17.670
Could I take your orders?

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:19.970
We already gave our order.

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:22.180
Right! Sorry about that!

00:07:22.550 --> 00:07:25.510
I wonder if something did happen yesterday.

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:30.350
Perhaps she took a step towards adulthood.

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:34.270
A step towards adulthood.

00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:37.190
I remember a time like that.

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:39.990
It brings back so many memories.

00:07:40.150 --> 00:07:41.950
When are you talking about?

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:44.620
A very

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:46.790
long time ago.

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:51.040
Welcome, welcome!

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:55.250
We've got fluffy, delicious zombie omelets
that will melt in your mouth!

00:07:55.420 --> 00:07:57.880
Don't be scared because of the name!
Just try them!

00:07:58.050 --> 00:07:59.720
Come on, come on!

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:04.430
I hear you have an unusual power.

00:08:08.140 --> 00:08:10.020
Can you really not talk?

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:14.770
Why are you always smiling?

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:24.280
Actually, you look like someone.

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:28.490
What are you doing?

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:31.710
Don't sneak up on me!

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:33.460
So any news since we last spoke?

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:35.540
No, nothing.

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:40.880
I see.

00:08:41.590 --> 00:08:44.050
Nothing new has happened on my end either.

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:47.050
It's been five days since I
came down to the lower world.

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:49.310
Sorry to hear that!

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:51.560
Sounds like things have been tough.

00:08:54.020 --> 00:08:55.560
Who is that child?

00:08:57.610 --> 00:08:59.280
Oh, this one?

00:08:59.440 --> 00:09:01.110
Just some demon kid, that's all.

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:05.740
I just picked the kid off the street
and put the brat to work.

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:19.710
Oh, right!

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:22.300
Hey, get back to work already!

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:23.800
You idiot.

00:09:23.970 --> 00:09:27.550
Now go over to Nina, okay?

00:09:36.850 --> 00:09:38.860
I will be back.

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:47.280
Why didn't you tell her the truth?

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:51.490
Don't sneak up on me either, idiot!

00:09:51.660 --> 00:09:55.410
Is it because Nina
would be sad if Mugaro went away?

00:09:55.580 --> 00:09:57.630
No!

00:09:57.790 --> 00:10:01.340
So you would have no problem
if I went and told Lady Sofiel?

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:04.010
About the color of the child's eyes?

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:06.010
Don't.

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:10.010
Why not? Then we would be able
to return to heaven!

00:10:11.970 --> 00:10:14.100
I have a bad feeling about it.

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:17.100
What do you mean by that?

00:10:57.810 --> 00:11:01.940
Don't you think it's messed up that the Orleans Knights
aren't in the parade?

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:04.530
I guess that's just how things go.

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:08.240
We haven't exactly accomplished much lately.

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:09.950
It's the captain!

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:13.240
Captain! Has something happened?

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:19.290
The demons are scheming something.

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:21.420
The parade will commence at noon.

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:24.800
We have to find and stop them before then!

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:27.630
You don't think they're after...

00:11:31.760 --> 00:11:33.180
What are you talking about?

00:11:33.350 --> 00:11:35.470
-Let us hurry!
-Alessand!

00:11:35.640 --> 00:11:37.890
Wait! Could you explain?

00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:39.390
What's going on?

00:11:50.110 --> 00:11:51.740
Why is she not coming?

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:01.330
I wonder what the parade is like.

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:03.630
Have you seen it before?

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:09.340
You can't see anything from here.

00:12:09.880 --> 00:12:12.890
I can't see!

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:24.730
Rage of Bahamut

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:36.620
Damn it.

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:01.770
We managed to get everything ready on our end.

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:03.270
How did it go with you?

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:04.940
It wasn't a problem.

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:07.860
Good. Wait for the signal, then.

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:29.040
I've got a good view now!

00:13:29.210 --> 00:13:32.050
Heh, the king's already come and gone.

00:13:32.210 --> 00:13:34.090
I don't really care about the king.

00:13:34.260 --> 00:13:38.100
-What?
-The parade is so cool!

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:43.680
-What's wrong?
-Nina?

00:13:46.350 --> 00:13:48.020
Hey!

00:13:53.320 --> 00:13:54.860
What's the big idea?

00:13:55.030 --> 00:13:58.070
Why did you not show up
where we were supposed to meet?

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:01.080
Because I was watching the parade!

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:09.840
Just come! We're out of time!

00:14:13.170 --> 00:14:14.880
Mugaro!

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:16.760
Help me, Mugaro.

00:14:17.220 --> 00:14:19.010
Mugaro?

00:14:21.010 --> 00:14:22.560
Is that you, Mugaro?

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:24.810
That's right. She's cute, isn't she?

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:14.110
Damn it.

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:25.200
Send the carriage back to the palace.

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:27.960
The other soldiers
should get back immediately as well.

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:29.870
It's no use.

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:33.880
All of our escape paths have been cut off.

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:36.920
We will not be able to easily return to the palace.

00:15:37.090 --> 00:15:39.170
That means that

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:41.760
this is where we battle the demons.

00:15:45.720 --> 00:15:48.980
Hey, what was that noise?

00:16:02.240 --> 00:16:04.530
What are you doing?

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:10.830
Yes?

00:16:18.260 --> 00:16:20.420
Seriously, what are you doing?

00:16:26.390 --> 00:16:28.100
I have no other choice.

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:45.820
Why are you not transforming?

00:16:46.780 --> 00:16:49.950
I'm not really sure why,

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:53.370
but my heart isn't racing at all.

00:16:56.540 --> 00:16:59.840
-The red dragon?
-There are no reports yet.

00:17:00.010 --> 00:17:01.840
They should have acted by now.

00:17:02.050 --> 00:17:03.840
What do we do?

00:17:06.470 --> 00:17:08.260
It's weird, isn't it?

00:17:08.430 --> 00:17:11.480
I was so excited just the other day.

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:18.520
Oh, do you think this is because
I've experienced true love?

00:17:18.690 --> 00:17:21.360
I have to stop the attack.

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:24.030
Love!

00:17:24.400 --> 00:17:26.280
I wonder where Azazel is going.

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:29.790
Honestly, what is with that guy?

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:33.160
Hurry! Rescue the survivors!

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:39.540
All free hands secure the area around the king!

00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:42.340
What do we do?

00:17:42.510 --> 00:17:45.180
We won't be able to take on any more reinforcements.

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:49.550
Did Azazel betray us?

00:17:50.060 --> 00:17:51.100
No.

00:17:51.260 --> 00:17:53.850
We have no other choice
than to wait for the red dragon.

00:17:54.020 --> 00:17:56.060
-If we were to move—
-You there!

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:01.440
Get over here.

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:16.080
They are demon rebels.

00:18:30.720 --> 00:18:32.010
Cut off their heads.

00:18:36.980 --> 00:18:38.810
-Not yet.
-Let go of me!

00:19:17.310 --> 00:19:18.310
Damn it.

00:19:23.400 --> 00:19:24.820
What happened?

00:19:24.980 --> 00:19:27.650
Hey, Mugaro...

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:41.290
Damn it!

00:19:41.460 --> 00:19:43.750
Where is the red dragon?

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:46.130
What is Azazel—

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:25.340
Lord Azazel!

00:20:33.930 --> 00:20:35.510
Finally.

00:20:35.680 --> 00:20:39.270
It is time we settle this once and for all.

00:21:01.080 --> 00:21:05.170
It's okay, it's okay
I cast the usual spell

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:09.300
Stagnation, stagnation
My words and heart are at odds

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:13.010
Default
I've taken all the paint

00:21:13.180 --> 00:21:17.430
And mixed up all the colors
Until you're left with me

00:21:17.930 --> 00:21:19.890
So fragile
Yet strong

00:21:20.060 --> 00:21:21.980
Close to overflowing
But not spilling

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:26.020
Because I'm incomplete
I won't amount to much

00:21:26.190 --> 00:21:30.360
This is just a good luck charm
I'm not asking for your help

00:21:30.530 --> 00:21:34.360
This is just a good luck charm
I was just clinging to you

00:21:34.650 --> 00:21:38.700
Let's end it all today

00:21:38.870 --> 00:21:42.950
I'm done living this pointless life

00:21:43.120 --> 00:21:47.130
Let's end it all today

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:52.010
I've taken my last pointless breath

00:21:52.590 --> 00:21:56.550
To whom it may concern, see ya and goodbye

00:21:56.720 --> 00:22:00.680
I killed the person I was yesterday

00:22:00.850 --> 00:22:05.390
To whom it may concern, see ya and goodbye

00:22:05.600 --> 00:22:11.690
A new morning is coming

00:22:39.840 --> 00:22:41.510
What happened to the red dragon?

00:22:48.100 --> 00:22:52.320
We were fools to have trusted you.

00:22:57.650 --> 00:22:59.610
I will draw them to me.

00:22:59.780 --> 00:23:00.870
You can't!

00:23:01.030 --> 00:23:02.870
I want you to live!

00:23:08.250 --> 00:23:09.250
Now!

00:23:15.550 --> 00:23:17.510
Don't let a single one get away!

00:23:34.400 --> 00:23:35.650
Dante...

00:23:47.080 --> 00:23:48.460
-This is Gabriel
-and Sofiel.

00:23:48.620 --> 00:23:49.620
We are Gods!

00:23:49.790 --> 00:23:52.500
Your hair is so silky and so well maintained

00:23:52.670 --> 00:23:55.170
-You are gorgeous as usual, Lord Gabriel.
-Oh my oh my...

00:23:55.340 --> 00:23:59.420
Next time on Rage of Bahamut:
Virgin Soul, "The Day of Defeat."

00:23:59.590 --> 00:24:01.180
-Is this how it's done?
-We are Gods!

00:24:01.340 --> 00:24:03.850
Baha Soul!!

00:24:04.100 --> 00:24:07.890
Lord Azazel,
what are you looking at?

00:24:08.850 --> 00:24:10.060
The future.
